        <proceduralStep>
          <title>General</title>
          <para>This procedure gives the requirements to preserve and store safely the front row monument assembly.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>Job Set-Up</title>
          <para>Make sure that the equipment is free of damage.</para>
          <para>Install the protection materials on the equipment with their blanking plugs.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>Storage</title>
          <para>Refer to CMM S1L LH / S1R RH FRONT ROW MONUMENT 25-23-86 for series H14510.</para>
          <para>Refer to CMM S2L LH / S2R RH FRONT ROW MONUMENT 25-23-88 for series H14530.</para>
          <para>Refer to CMM S1C / S2C CENTER FRONT ROW MONUMENT 25-23-89 for series H14540.</para>
        </proceduralStep>
        <proceduralStep>
          <title>Job Close-Up</title>
